    "title": "Iowa State's Lipsey, Creighton's Dix ink undrafted free agent deals following 2026 NBA Draft - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Anthony Mitchell ,\n1 hours ago\nIowa State guard Tamin Lipsey and Creighton guard Josh Dix did not hear their names called during the 2026 NBA Draft, but were among the first players to sign undrafted free deals.\nLipsey agreed to an Exhibit 10 deal with the Indiana Pacers while Dix inked a two-way deal with the Oklahoma City Thunder.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KCAU 9 News | Sioux City, IA | News, Weather, and Sports.",
